Package: plasticdb
Type: Package
Title: Client for the PlasticDB Plastic Biodegradation Database
Version: 0.99.4
Authors@R:
    person("Victor", "Gambarini", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "victor.gambarini@gmail.com")
Description: Query PlasticDB (<https://v2.plasticdb.org>), a curated database of
    microorganisms and proteins linked to plastic biodegradation, and the
    evidence behind each link (interactions, experiments and observations).
    Catalogue tables are returned as tibbles and protein sequences as
    'Biostrings' AAStringSet objects. Reads can be pinned to a named, citable
    dataset release; answers from a pinned release are cached on disk with
    'BiocFileCache'. Jobs run PlasticDB's analyses on the server (DIAMOND
    annotation of genes, genomes and genome sets, taxa-table matching,
    pathway mapping, HMM screens and taxonomy trees) from files, FASTA text
    or 'Biostrings' sets. The data is licensed CC BY 4.0: cite() returns the
    citation for the release used.
